  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 07/05/2026, the continuous use of part of the detached rear outbuilding '71 Imperial Road, Feltham, TW14 8AE' as a self-contained residential unit was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that on the balance of probabilities, the part detached rear outbuilding at  '71 Imperial Road, Feltham, TW14 8AE' has been used as a self-contained residential unit, for an uninterrupted period of at least four years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). \r\n"
  ],
